Modifications by this application: the original PyTorch models were exported to
ONNX opset 17. The common history LSTM is evaluated once per inference batch and
expanded for that legal action batch. Original network weights are unchanged. The bundled
application encodes public observations and supplies only its own legal moves.
Export scripts, checkpoint URLs, hashes and parity validation are documented in
docs/offline-ai.md and manifest.json.
